 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 527096,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "The dosage recommendations for a popular brand of acetaminophen are listed in table below. What is the recommended dosage for a child who weighs 17,683 grams?\n<table class=\"unnumbered\" summary=\".\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Weight</th>\n<th>Dosage</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>11 kg to 15 kg</td>\n<td>5 mL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr><td>16 kg to 21 kg</td>\n<td>7.5 mL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr><td>22 kg to 27 kg</td>\n<td>10 mL</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "7.5 mL"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Prefix</td>\n<td>kilo-</td>\n<td>hecto-</td>\n<td>deca-</td>\n<td>base</td>\n<td>deci-</td>\n<td>centi-</td>\n<td>milli-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Abbreviation</td>\n<td>k</td>\n<td>h</td>\n<td>da</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>d</td>\n<td>c</td>\n<td>m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Magnitude</td>\n<td>10<sup>3</sup></td>\n<td>10<sup>2</sup></td>\n<td>10<sup>1</sup></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>10<sup>−1</sup></td>\n<td>10<sup>−2</sup></td>\n<td>10<sup>−3</sup></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Step 1: Convert the grams to kilograms.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"17,683{\\text{ }}\\cancel{{{\\text{grams}}}}\\left( {\\frac{{1{\\text{ kilogram}}}}{{1,000{\\text{ }}\\cancel{{{\\text{grams}}}}}}} \\right) = {\\text{ 17}}{\\text{.863 kilograms}}\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 2: Use the chart to identify the dosage.</p>\n<p>The child fits within the 16 to 21 kg range.</p>\n <p>The correct dosage is 7.5 mL.</p>\n"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
